<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">Limits and the next step</span>
    Level 1 is generally based on <strong>exact words and names</strong>. As files pile up it gets messy and things are easily missed. That is when you move on to <a href="#!sb-level2">Level 2 &mdash; the LLM wiki and memory</a>, which <strong>groups by topic</strong>. (Note: copying <code>CLAUDE.md</code> into an <code>AGENTS.md</code> for Codex lets you keep using it even when you switch tools, and this <strong>tool independence</strong> is covered at level 2.)
</div>
